# Public origin checklist for split-origin production (no secrets).
#
# Copy this file locally, fill in real domains, then propagate values to:
#   - deploy/.env.ec2 (on EC2, not committed)
#   - Cloudflare Pages environment variables
#   - GitHub repository Variables (optional, for post-deploy verify)
#
# Step-by-step validation: deploy/CHECKLIST.md

API_PUBLIC_ORIGIN=https://api.example.com
FRONTEND_PUBLIC_ORIGIN=https://app.example.com

# ── deploy/.env.ec2 (EC2 host) ─────────────────────────────────
# DEPLOY_BASE_URL=${API_PUBLIC_ORIGIN}
# DEPLOY_FRONTEND_BASE_URL=${FRONTEND_PUBLIC_ORIGIN}
#
# BACKEND_CORS_ORIGINS must list every browser origin that will call this API.
# Production frontend only:
#   BACKEND_CORS_ORIGINS=${FRONTEND_PUBLIC_ORIGIN}
# Preview deployments also hitting this API (add each real Preview origin):
#   BACKEND_CORS_ORIGINS=${FRONTEND_PUBLIC_ORIGIN},https://<branch>.<project>.pages.dev
#
# If Preview uses a separate staging API, keep production CORS to production
# frontend only and set Preview VITE_API_BASE_URL to the staging API in Pages.

# ── Cloudflare Pages ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Production (required):
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=${API_PUBLIC_ORIGIN}
# Preview — pick one:
#   A) Same as Production → must add Preview origin(s) to BACKEND_CORS_ORIGINS above
#   B) Separate staging API → Preview VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.staging.example.com
#      (do not add pages.dev to production BACKEND_CORS_ORIGINS)
# CF_PAGES=1 builds fail if Preview environment omits VITE_API_BASE_URL entirely.

# ── GitHub repository Variables ───────────────────────────────
# DEPLOY_BASE_URL=${API_PUBLIC_ORIGIN}
# DEPLOY_FRONTEND_BASE_URL=${FRONTEND_PUBLIC_ORIGIN}
#
# Or bootstrap via CLI (from repo root, gh authenticated):
#   BOOTSTRAP_DEPLOY_BASE_URL=${API_PUBLIC_ORIGIN} \
#   BOOTSTRAP_DEPLOY_FRONTEND_BASE_URL=${FRONTEND_PUBLIC_ORIGIN} \
#   bash scripts/ci/bootstrap_github_gate.sh

# ── Google OAuth (only when GOOGLE_OAUTH_ENABLED=true) ────────
# GOOGLE_ALLOWED_REDIRECT_URIS=${FRONTEND_PUBLIC_ORIGIN}/auth/google/callback
